      "message": "The CC1_BPS and CC2_BPS bits can be cleared individually when FRS is enabled, so the state of these bits needs to be tracked.\n\nZhuohao is correct that if VBAT_OVP is still ongoing, then the re-enable of CCx_BPS needs to be deferred until VBAT_OVP is clear.\n\nPsuedo-code:\n    if (regval \u0026 SYV682X_CONTROL_4_VBAT_OVP) {\n        /* Set ovp_recovery_needed for port */\n        hook_call_deferred(\u0026syv682x_vbat_ovp_deferred_data, delay);\n    }\n\n    syv682x_vbat_ovp_deferred ()\n    {\n        /* For all ports */\n        if (ovp_recovery_needed)\n            if (reg4 \u0026 SYV682X_CONTROL_4_VBAT_OVP)\n                /* VBAT_OVP still present, retry recovery */\n                hook_call_deferred(\u0026syv682x_vbat_ovp_deferred_data, delay);\n            else\n                /* Clear ovp_recovery_needed */\n                /* Set CCx_BPS bits\n    }",
