      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Keith, From my knowledge(I could be wrong, please correct me if I\u0027m wrong), If we use the hook_call_deferred, the syv682x_vbat_ovp_deferred() will be running under the hook task context. The race condition may happen in between PD task and Hook task when doing the register read/write. Will it a concern?",
