      "writtenOn": "2020-10-21T20:43:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The interrupt processing is currently being done from the HOOKS task. I2C register read/writes are already locked with a mutex, so there is no issue with register access.  Any flags used to track the CCx_BPS setting will need to use the atomic operations similar to the irq_pending flag.",
